{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1383604-ideas-on-how-to-clean-up-slums","id":1383604,"title":"Ideas on how to clean up slums?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-24T08:25:57-07:00","id":1383604,"title":"Ideas on how to clean up slums?","content":"ideas how to clean up slums, if your a supernatural who wants to do so?<br /> <br /> or just a wealthy philanthropist.<br /> <br /> In a game Im currently running, a Daeva is trying to issue a Scholarship for a trade school to residents of the slums<br /> <br /> Shes thinking on moving the students to elsewhere to keep them from being distracted by gang violence or having things stolen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 04-24-2020, 11:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-24T11:32:56-07:00","id":1383636,"title":"","content":"As a vampire she would probably be able to do something more directly to stop gang violence or theft in the area. You would probably want to narrow down what you mean by 'slums' too, from a geographical standpoint (is it just one area? or is it every slum in a city?). Either way social assistance and infrastructure can really help. They've worked in places like Pune and Mukuru. As a wealthy person, making sure there are opportunities and safety are big. While a trade school can help, it might result in a sort of brain-drain, where people from the area become trained, then leave, which is a lot like the moving students elsewhere issue, not fixing the slums as much as taking some people out of it.<br /> <br /> They might look into the broken windows theory. As they are not police or authority, they would probably be able to avoid the problematic aspects of policing based off the idea, but the idea that literally cleaning up an area (and making sure it stays clean) seems to hold, as a big problems with Pune and Mukuru was the lack of infrastructure for waste disposal. Some moves to ensure the area gets the same preference for service that other areas do in terms of waste management, telecommunications, internet access, emergency services responses and so forth could go a long way.<br /> <br /> But it's the type of thing that would take a lot of work and dedication, investments of time and money and power (both natural and supernatural).<br /> <br /> If you want to really simplify it just have them get rid of all the criminals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-26T20:23:01-07:00","id":1384088,"title":"","content":"It might help to know what mundane and supernatural abilities the vampire has. I would think the more social vampires are better suited for it. A ventrue may be able to pull lots of strings with politicians and capitalists to make them do something for the slums, while a daeva could raise a collective will among people to work together. A gangrel could possibly enter a gang and become its leader, in order to reform it in some way. A mekhet or nosferatu must work even more subtly than that, possibly by using Obfuscate and other means to promote politicians who focus on helping the poor and undermining politicians who don't.<br /> <br /> Think about what kind of obstacles there would be. Obviously there many parties who benefit from it being a zone with less vigilance and social control and would oppose a movement to improve things. Maybe there is a powerful spirit of violence haunting the area and suddenly the vampire would find someone who could deal with spirits, such as werewolves or mages. Maybe the ghosts of gang violence are strong in the area and pulls it down in their collective grief, better find a necromancer of some kind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T23:12:18-07:00","id":1384364,"title":"","content":"Getting rid of a slum is easy and happens all of the time, it's called Gentrification. Of course it also gets rid of the people living in that slum so if your goal was to help them...you failed big time.<br /> At its root the secret to getting rid of a slum, but not the people, is really simple in concept but very difficult in execution, what you need to do is provide employment and not just a job that provides a decent paycheck but one that also provides growth potential with a future not only for the current generation but also those that will follow.<br /> The average person (in or out of slums) if given a chance to make a good living doing something they can be proud of will not turn to crime, offer the same chance to their children and they won't either.<br /> If you manage that then Gentrification will occur all on its own, but it will be in the form of the locals improving their environment as opposed to outsiders snatching up cheap property.<br /> <br /> The difficulty with doing this is not only dealing with the criminal elements that find what you are attempting to be bad for their business, but you also have to sale the locals on the promised future before they see the payout. Otherwise whatever you set up will be stripped clean and vandalized before it even gets off the ground.<br /> This might actually be easy for a Daeva to pull off, not only are they likely to have the means to deal with the criminal empires in the neighborhood, but they can probably use Majesty and their own cult of personality to get the locals excited about what is coming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}